@integrations/skills/sigil/compilation-execution.sigil import { SigilCompilationExecution }
@integrations/skills/sigil/design-conversation.sigil import { SigilDesignConversation }

component SigilDesignCompilationReview {
  goal {
    Inspect native Design coherence for current authored scope and use concrete
    findings to improve the written contract without inventing evaluator stages.
  }

  interface {
    DesignCompilationReview {
      Use SigilCompilationExecution with compile design and an explicit native scope
      where focus is needed.

      Read the world state, diagnostics, source attribution, input identities and
      warnings from the native JSON report.

      Coherent is green and Loose is yellow, both exit zero.

      Disjoint is red and exits one.

      Unavailable or failed operations do not establish coherence.
    }
  }
}

expand SigilDesignCompilationReview {
  logic {
    DesignCompilationReview {
      Write authorized scoped Design changes and inspect native freshness.

      Obtain independent reconstructions before claiming current semantic
      verification.

      Review diagnostics against their source.

      Resolve established corrections within authorized scope.

      Route genuinely unresolved intent to SigilDesignConversation; a warning does
      not itself require a new permission round trip.

      Preserve remaining unknowns explicitly.
    }
  }

  constraints {
    DesignCompilationReview {
      Native scope owns root order, import closure and physical-file membership.

      Do not rebuild a target-ranking algorithm or silently narrow final scope.

      Structural check success is not semantic coherence.

      Coherent or Loose does not prove implementation, tests, code removal or full
      task completion.

      Catalog availability is a native decision; a missing catalog cannot be replaced
      by a handwritten identity list or an assumed green report.

      Human product decisions remain external; the coding agent must spawn a subagent
      for reconstruction and retain its isolation evidence.
    }
  }

  cases {
    DesignCompilationReview {
      A Loose report retains warnings with exit zero. A concrete missing behavior
      still requires work; an evidence limitation is not silently relabeled as
      completion. A Disjoint report returns its contradictory assertions for
      investigation without automatically rewriting the user's intent.
    }
  }
}
